WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Friday, eight thirty New York time. Gold jumps.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:09.280
NFP: the US jobs report.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.720
Step one: Strong numbers often push gold down.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:17.720
Step two: The surprise is what counts.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:23.120
Step three: The first spike often reverses.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:27.820
Mistake: jumping in right before the number. A coin flip.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.420
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.040
I show days like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
